{"seq":2,"slug":"observability","title":"数据产品可观测性体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/observability","wordCount":1385,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据产品可观测性体系\">数据产品可观测性体系</h1><p>一个数据产品发布上线只是开始——真正的挑战是持续保障它在生产环境中<strong>可靠、可信、可度量</strong>。数据产品可观测性不是事后补充的监控，而是产品设计的第一等组件。它回答三个核心问题：数据产品是否按承诺运行（SLA）？数据内容是否正确（质量）？消费者是否在有效使用（价值）？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据产品可观测性借鉴了软件可观测性的三大支柱（Metrics、Logs、Traces），但针对数据场景做了重新定义：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 数据可观测性三支柱&#10;        direction LR&#10;        Freshness[新鲜度&lt;br/&gt;数据是否按时到达]&#10;        Quality[质量&lt;br/&gt;数据内容是否正确]&#10;        Usage[使用量&lt;br/&gt;消费者是否在用]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 监控维度&#10;        Schema[Schema 变更&lt;br/&gt;结构是否稳定]&#10;        Volume[数据量&lt;br/&gt;是否异常波动]&#10;        Lineage[血缘完整性&lt;br/&gt;上下游是否正常]&#10;    end&#10;    Freshness --&gt; SLA[SLA 达成率]&#10;    Quality --&gt; Score[质量分数]&#10;    Usage --&gt; Value[业务价值]&#10;    Schema --&gt; Drift[漂移检测]&#10;    Volume --&gt; Anomaly[异常检测]&#10;    Lineage --&gt; Impact[影响分析]\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 数据可观测性三支柱\n        direction LR\n        Freshness[新鲜度&lt;br/&gt;数据是否按时到达]\n        Quality[质量&lt;br/&gt;数据内容是否正确]\n        Usage[使用量&lt;br/&gt;消费者是否在用]\n    end\n    subgraph 监控维度\n        Schema[Schema 变更&lt;br/&gt;结构是否稳定]\n        Volume[数据量&lt;br/&gt;是否异常波动]\n        Lineage[血缘完整性&lt;br/&gt;上下游是否正常]\n    end\n    Freshness --&gt; SLA[SLA 达成率]\n    Quality --&gt; Score[质量分数]\n    Usage --&gt; Value[业务价值]\n    Schema --&gt; Drift[漂移检测]\n    Volume --&gt; Anomaly[异常检测]\n    Lineage --&gt; Impact[影响分析]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可观测性维度</th>\n<th>度量指标</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>告警阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新鲜度</td>\n<td>最新记录的年龄</td>\n<td>管道调度日志</td>\n<td>&gt; SLA 承诺值的 120%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性</td>\n<td>NULL 率、记录数变化</td>\n<td>质量检查结果</td>\n<td>NULL 率 &gt; 5% 或记录数降 &gt; 30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性</td>\n<td>业务规则通过率</td>\n<td>契约质量规则执行</td>\n<td>通过率 &lt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 稳定性</td>\n<td>变更频率、兼容性</td>\n<td>Schema 注册中心</td>\n<td>非预期 breaking change</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用量</td>\n<td>查询次数、唯一消费者数</td>\n<td>查询日志/API 日志</td>\n<td>7 日无任何消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>计算/存储费用</td>\n<td>云账单 API</td>\n<td>超出域预算 80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"新鲜度监控-数据是否按时到达\">新鲜度监控：数据是否按时到达</h2><p>新鲜度是数据产品最基本的 SLA 维度——如果数据到不了，其他一切都无意义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"监控策略\">监控策略</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>管道完成时间追踪</strong>：记录每次管道运行的开始和结束时间</li>\n<li><strong>最新记录时间戳</strong>：检查输出表中最新记录的事件时间</li>\n<li><strong>SLA 违约检测</strong>：将实际新鲜度与契约中承诺的 SLA 对比</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"异常模式识别\">异常模式识别</h3><p>正常的新鲜度波动（如周末数据量少导致微小延迟）vs 异常信号（管道失败、上游延迟传播）需要区分。实践中通常设置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬阈值</strong>：超过 SLA 承诺值立即告警</li>\n<li><strong>软阈值</strong>：偏离历史基线 2 个标准差时预警</li>\n<li><strong>趋势告警</strong>：连续 3 次刷新逐渐变慢时提前预警</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量监控-内容是否正确\">数据质量监控：内容是否正确</h2><p>数据到了但内容错误——这是比&quot;没到&quot;更危险的失败模式，因为消费者可能在不知情的情况下基于错误数据做决策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量规则的分层执行\">质量规则的分层执行</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 管道内检查&#10;        R1[Schema 校验&lt;br/&gt;类型、nullable]&#10;        R2[业务规则&lt;br/&gt;值域、一致性]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 定时巡检&#10;        R3[统计分布&lt;br/&gt;漂移检测]&#10;        R4[跨产品一致性&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 消费者反馈&#10;        R5[质量投诉&lt;br/&gt;手动标记]&#10;        R6[隐式信号&lt;br/&gt;使用量骤降]&#10;    end&#10;    R1 --&gt; Score[质量分数]&#10;    R2 --&gt; Score&#10;    R3 --&gt; Score&#10;    R4 --&gt; Score&#10;    R5 --&gt; Score&#10;    R6 --&gt; Score\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 管道内检查\n        R1[Schema 校验&lt;br/&gt;类型、nullable]\n        R2[业务规则&lt;br/&gt;值域、一致性]\n    end\n    subgraph 定时巡检\n        R3[统计分布&lt;br/&gt;漂移检测]\n        R4[跨产品一致性&lt;br/&gt;交叉验证]\n    end\n    subgraph 消费者反馈\n        R5[质量投诉&lt;br/&gt;手动标记]\n        R6[隐式信号&lt;br/&gt;使用量骤降]\n    end\n    R1 --&gt; Score[质量分数]\n    R2 --&gt; Score\n    R3 --&gt; Score\n    R4 --&gt; Score\n    R5 --&gt; Score\n    R6 --&gt; Score</pre><h3 id=\"质量分数的计算\">质量分数的计算</h3><p>将多个维度的质量检查聚合为单一的&quot;质量分数&quot;（0-100），使消费者快速判断产品是否适合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{score} = w_1 \\cdot C_{completeness} + w_2 \\cdot A_{accuracy} + w_3 \\cdot V_{validity} + w_4 \\cdot T_{timeliness}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各维度的权重（由数据产品负责人根据场景设定），各维度分数为该维度下通过的规则比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据漂移检测\">数据漂移检测</h3><p>统计分布随时间的变化可能揭示上游数据源的潜在问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数值型字段</strong>：均值、标准差、分位数的偏移</li>\n<li><strong>分类型字段</strong>：类别分布比例的变化、新类别出现</li>\n<li><strong>数据量</strong>：日/周/月级别的记录数趋势异常</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"使用量与价值监控\">使用量与价值监控</h2><p>一个没人用的数据产品是资源浪费。使用量监控帮助识别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>活跃产品</strong>：消费者稳定、查询频繁 → 确认价值</li>\n<li><strong>僵尸产品</strong>：发布后无人使用 → 需审视是否该退役</li>\n<li><strong>过热产品</strong>：消费者过多、查询峰值高 → 可能需要性能优化</li>\n<li><strong>衰减产品</strong>：使用量持续下降 → 需要了解消费者迁移到了哪里</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"业务价值归因\">业务价值归因</h3><p>最有雄心的可观测性实践是将数据产品与<strong>业务结果</strong>关联：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>哪些 A/B 测试使用了该产品的数据？测试结论是否可信？</li>\n<li>哪些 ML 模型的 Feature 来自该产品？模型性能是否因数据质量波动而受影响？</li>\n<li>哪些仪表盘引用了该产品？仪表盘的活跃用户数？</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性基础设施\">可观测性基础设施</h2><h3 id=\"技术栈选型\">技术栈选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>开源方案</th>\n<th>商业方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据质量监控</td>\n<td>Great Expectations、Soda Core</td>\n<td>Monte Carlo、Bigeye</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 监控</td>\n<td>Schema Registry + CDC</td>\n<td>Atlan、Alation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血缘追踪</td>\n<td>OpenLineage + Marquez</td>\n<td>DataHub Cloud、Atlan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常检测</td>\n<td>自研统计模型</td>\n<td>Monte Carlo Data Observability</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用量追踪</td>\n<td>查询日志 + 自研聚合</td>\n<td>Atlan Data Products Analytics</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"告警路由\">告警路由</h3><p>不同严重级别的告警应路由到不同的接收人：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P0 - 数据不可用</strong>：数据产品负责人 + 值班工程师（即时通知）</li>\n<li><strong>P1 - SLA 违约</strong>：域数据工程师（15 分钟内响应）</li>\n<li><strong>P2 - 质量下降</strong>：数据产品负责人（工作时间内处理）</li>\n<li><strong>P3 - 趋势预警</strong>：周报汇总，下个 sprint 处理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性驱动的改进循环\">可观测性驱动的改进循环</h2><p>可观测性不只是&quot;出了问题发告警&quot;——它应该驱动数据产品的持续改进：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Monitor[监控] --&gt; Detect[发现问题]&#10;    Detect --&gt; Diagnose[诊断根因]&#10;    Diagnose --&gt; Fix[修复]&#10;    Fix --&gt; Prevent[预防]&#10;    Prevent --&gt; Monitor&#10;    Detect -.-&gt; RCA[根因分析&lt;br/&gt;5 Whys]&#10;    Prevent -.-&gt; Rule[新增质量规则&lt;br/&gt;更新契约]\">flowchart LR\n    Monitor[监控] --&gt; Detect[发现问题]\n    Detect --&gt; Diagnose[诊断根因]\n    Diagnose --&gt; Fix[修复]\n    Fix --&gt; Prevent[预防]\n    Prevent --&gt; Monitor\n    Detect -.-&gt; RCA[根因分析&lt;br/&gt;5 Whys]\n    Prevent -.-&gt; Rule[新增质量规则&lt;br/&gt;更新契约]</pre><p>每次质量事件都应产出两个交付物：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>即时修复（让数据恢复正确）</li>\n<li>预防措施（新增规则或检查，避免同类问题复发）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据产品可观测性 = 新鲜度 + 质量 + 使用量的持续监控</li>\n<li>质量分数聚合多维度检查为单一可消费指标</li>\n<li>使用量监控识别僵尸产品和过热产品</li>\n<li>可观测性应驱动改进循环，而非仅用于告警</li>\n<li>不同严重级别的问题路由到不同接收人</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"federated-governance-automation\">联邦计算治理</a>——可观测性是治理执行的反馈通道</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../mlops-platform/serving/canary-ab-deployment\">MLOps Canary 部署与 A/B</a>——模型服务的可观测性实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据产品可观测性体系","id":"数据产品可观测性体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"新鲜度监控：数据是否按时到达","id":"新鲜度监控-数据是否按时到达"},{"level":3,"text":"监控策略","id":"监控策略"},{"level":3,"text":"异常模式识别","id":"异常模式识别"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量监控：内容是否正确","id":"数据质量监控-内容是否正确"},{"level":3,"text":"质量规则的分层执行","id":"质量规则的分层执行"},{"level":3,"text":"质量分数的计算","id":"质量分数的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"数据漂移检测","id":"数据漂移检测"},{"level":2,"text":"使用量与价值监控","id":"使用量与价值监控"},{"level":3,"text":"业务价值归因","id":"业务价值归因"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性基础设施","id":"可观测性基础设施"},{"level":3,"text":"技术栈选型","id":"技术栈选型"},{"level":3,"text":"告警路由","id":"告警路由"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性驱动的改进循环","id":"可观测性驱动的改进循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"联邦计算治理的自动化实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/federated-governance-automation"},"next":{"title":"数据网格成熟度模型与演进路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/maturity-model"}}